# Duman ve iki ardisik savas dunyasinin temizligi, sonra dogal zafer ve prim.
# Kaynak senaryolarin emirleri korunur; ilk bolumun artefakt adlari smoke- oneki alir.
# Volley baseline'in ayri kosu varyanti; orijinal script ve artefaktlar korunur.
# Atis sonrasi normal selection ile suvariye gecilir. Id3 ammo yine JSON'dan okunur.
# Yakinda vurulmus/hovered topcu etiketi selection olmadan da gorunebilir; karede kontrol edilir.
new
lang ru
select champagne
expect ResolvedBattleCount 0
march
battle wait active 5
battle pause on
battle select 1 replace
battle select 2 add
battle formation line
battle fire hold
battle move -8 0
battle select 3 replace
battle formation column
battle move -10 10
battle select 4 replace
battle fire hold
battle move 14 -6
battle state smoke-00-deployment
shot smoke-00-start
battle pause off
battle wait arrived 45
battle wait volley-ready 30
expect BattleSelectionArrived True
expect BattleCanVolley True
battle pause on
battle state smoke-01-before-shot-paused
shot smoke-01-before-shot-paused
wait 0.75
battle state smoke-02-pause-held
expect BattlePaused True
expect BattleHasOutcome False
shot smoke-02-pause-held
battle pause off
battle wait volley-ready 5
battle state smoke-03-before-accepted-order
battle volley
wait 0.12
battle pause on
battle select 3 replace
battle state smoke-04-early-clouds
expect BattlePaused True
expect BattleHasOutcome False
shot smoke-04-early-clouds
wait 0.75
battle state smoke-05-clouds-pause-held
shot smoke-05-clouds-pause-held
battle pause off
wait 1.1
battle pause on
battle state smoke-06-developed-clouds
expect BattlePaused True
shot smoke-06-developed-clouds
battle pause off
wait 6.5
battle pause on
battle state smoke-07-clouds-cleared-candidate
expect BattlePaused True
expect BattleHasOutcome False
shot smoke-07-clouds-cleared-candidate
retreat
accept
battle verify-return
expect BattleActive False
expect ResolvedBattleCount 1
state smoke-08-campaign-return
shot smoke-08-campaign-return

# Gercek dogal zafer -> temel sonuc -> siyasi prim; sonuc/state enjeksiyonu yok.
new
lang ru
select champagne
expect HasPendingVictory False
expect ResolvedBattleCount 0
state 01-before-encounter
shot 01-champagne-route
march
battle wait active 5
battle pause on
expect BattleActive True
expect BattlePaused True
expect BattleHasOutcome False
battle state 02-deployment
shot 02-deployment-paused

# Daha once gercek oyuncuda kazanmis ortak oyuncu emirleri.
battle select 1 replace
battle select 2 add
battle formation line
battle fire hold
battle move -8 0
battle select 3 replace
battle formation column
battle move -10 10
battle select 4 replace
battle fire hold
battle move 14 -6
battle state 03-issued-orders
shot 03-issued-orders
battle pause off
expect BattlePaused False
battle wait arrived 45
expect BattleSelectionArrived True
battle wait volley-ready 30
expect BattleCanVolley True
battle volley
battle state 04-volley-order
shot 04-artillery-volley
battle fire free
battle select 1 replace
battle select 2 add
battle fire free
battle move 1 4
battle select 3 replace
battle formation line
battle move 0 6
battle state 05-committed-forces
shot 05-contested-crossing
battle wait ended 120
expect BattleEnded True
expect BattleWon True
expect BattleHasOutcome True
battle state 06-natural-outcome
shot 06-natural-report-ru
lang tr
shot 07-natural-report-tr
accept
battle verify-return
expect BattleActive False
expect Busy False
expect ResolvedBattleCount 1
expect HasPendingVictory True
state 07-base-victory
save
remember pending-victory

# Pencereyi kapatmak odulu reddetmez; pending kayit gercek Load ile geri gelir.
victory-close
expect HasPendingVictory True
select normandy
load
same pending-victory
expect HasPendingVictory True
state 08-loaded-pending
lang ru
panel victory
shot 08-pending-choice-ru
lang tr
shot 09-pending-choice-tr

# Secili harita bolgesi degisse de prim gercek Champagne zaferine bagli kalir.
victory-close
select normandy
panel victory
state 09-before-bonus
shot 10-original-region-terms
victory bonus
expect HasPendingVictory False
expect ResolvedBattleCount 1
state 10-after-bonus
wait 0.6
lang ru
shot 11-bonus-result-ru
lang tr
shot 12-bonus-result-tr

# Basarili secim otomatik kaydeder. Load onceki teklifi tekrar acmamalidir.
remember paid-victory
select brittany
load
same paid-victory
expect HasPendingVictory False
state 11-loaded-autosave
save
select picardy
load
same paid-victory
expect HasPendingVictory False
state 12-loaded-explicit-save
shot 13-loaded-final-atlas
quit
